2026-03-16 11:46:57 - selenium.webdriver.remote.remote_connection - DEBUG - Remote response: status=200 | data={"value":"\u003Cdiv class=\"keyvalue fundcomps aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12\">\n\n\n    \n    \n    \n    \u003Csection data-fundcomponent=\"true\">\n        \n            \u003Ch2 class=\"comp-title\">\n                Fund Characteristics\n                \n                \n                    \u003Cspan class=\"date\">as of Mar 13 2026\u003C/span>\n                \n                \u003Csvg class=\"ssmpsvg caret-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u003Cuse xlink:href=\"#caret-down\">\u003C/use>\u003C/svg>\n            \u003C/h2>\n        \n        \n        \n\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"section-content\">\n            \n                \u003Ctable class=\"tb-keyvalue\">\n                    \u003Ctbody>\n                    \n                        \u003Ctr>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"label\">\n                                Number of Holdings\n                            \u003C/td>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"data\">5,159\u003C/td>\n                        \u003C/tr>\n                    \n                        \u003Ctr>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"label\">\n                                Average Coupon\n    \u003Cspan class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        \u003Csvg class=\"ssmpsvg icon_info\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            \u003Cuse xlink:href=\"#icon_info\">\u003C/use>\n        \u003C/svg>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"info-data\">\n            \u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>﻿Average Coupon\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003Cp>The market value weighted average coupon of the bonds in a portfolio.\u003C/p>\n        \u003C/div>\n    \u003C/span>\n\n                            \u003C/td>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"data\">4.58%\u003C/td>\n                        \u003C/tr>\n                    \n                        \u003Ctr>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"label\">\n                                Average Maturity in Years\n    \u003Cspan class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        \u003Csvg class=\"ssmpsvg icon_info\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            \u003Cuse xlink:href=\"#icon_info\">\u003C/use>\n        \u003C/svg>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"info-data\">\n            \u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Average Maturity\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003Cp>The market value-weighted average maturity of the bonds and loans in a portfolio, where maturity is the length of time during which the investor will receive interest payments on the investment. When the bond reaches maturity the principal is repaid.\u003C/p>\n        \u003C/div>\n    \u003C/span>\n\n                            \u003C/td>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"data\">4.88\u003C/td>\n                        \u003C/tr>\n                    \n                        \u003Ctr>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"label\">\n                                Average Price\n    \u003Cspan class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        \u003Csvg class=\"ssmpsvg icon_info\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            \u003Cuse xlink:href=\"#icon_info\">\u003C/use>\n        \u003C/svg>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"info-data\">\n            \u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>\u003C/strong>\u003Cstrong>Average Price\u003C/strong> The weighted average of each asset’s market price relative to its face value or par value.\u003C/p>\n        \u003C/div>\n    \u003C/span>\n\n                            \u003C/td>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"data\">$99.49\u003C/td>\n                        \u003C/tr>\n                    \n                        \u003Ctr>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"label\">\n                                Average Yield To Worst\n    \u003Cspan class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        \u003Csvg class=\"ssmpsvg icon_info\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            \u003Cuse xlink:href=\"#icon_info\">\u003C/use>\n        \u003C/svg>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"info-data\">\n            \u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Average Yield To Worst\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003Cp>The lowest potential yield that can be received on a bond without the issuer actually defaulting. The YTW is calculated by making worst-case scenario assumptions on the issue by calculating the return that would be received if the issuer uses provisions, including prepayments. When aggregating YTW for a portfolio level statistic, the weighted average of the YTW and market value for each security is used.\u003C/p>\n        \u003C/div>\n    \u003C/span>\n\n                            \u003C/td>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"data\">4.80%\u003C/td>\n                        \u003C/tr>\n                    \n                        \u003Ctr>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"label\">\n                                Option Adjusted Duration\n    \u003Cspan class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        \u003Csvg class=\"ssmpsvg icon_info\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            \u003Cuse xlink:href=\"#icon_info\">\u003C/use>\n        \u003C/svg>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"info-data\">\n            \u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Option&nbsp;Adjusted\u003C/strong> \u003Cstrong>Duration\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003Cp>Also known as effective duration which is a duration calculation that takes into account the effect of embedded options in bonds.&nbsp;An option-adjusted measure of a bond's (or portfolio's) sensitivity to changes in interest rates calculated as the average percentage change in a bond's value (price plus accrued interest) under shifts of the Treasury curve +/- 100 bps.&nbsp;\u003C/p>\n        \u003C/div>\n    \u003C/span>\n\n                            \u003C/td>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"data\">4.11 years\u003C/td>\n                        \u003C/tr>\n                    \n                        \u003Ctr>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"label\">\n                                Option Adjusted Spread\n                            \u003C/td>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"data\">86.25\u003C/td>\n                        \u003C/tr>\n                    \n                        \u003Ctr>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"label\">\n                                Yield to Maturity\n    \u003Cspan class=\"info\" tabindex=\"0\">\n        \u003Csvg class=\"ssmpsvg icon_info\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            \u003Cuse xlink:href=\"#icon_info\">\u003C/use>\n        \u003C/svg>\n        \u003Cdiv class=\"info-data\">\n            \u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Yield to Maturity\u003C/strong>\u003C/p>\u003Cp>The market weighted average rate of return anticipated on the bonds held in a portfolio if they were to be held to their maturity date.\u003C/p>\n        \u003C/div>\n    \u003C/span>\n\n                            \u003C/td>\n                            \u003Ctd class=\"data\">4.81%\u003C/td>\n                        \u003C/tr>\n                    \n                    \n                    \u003C/tbody>\n                \u003C/table>\n            \n\n            \n\n            \u003C!-- Premium Discount to NAV Graph Start -->\n            \n            \u003C!-- Premium Discount to NAV Graph End -->\n\n            \n\n            \n                \u003Cdiv class=\"download\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                \u003C/div>\n            \n            \n        \u003C/div>\n    \u003C/section>\n\u003C/div>"} | headers=HTTPHeaderDict({'Content-Length': '7401', 'Content-Type': 'application/json; charset=utf-8', 'cache-control': 'no-cache'})
